## Decisions NOT Made / Deferred

- **Peek strip for swipe gestures:** Discussed as an alternative to the current swipe-to-toast pattern. Would reveal a colored strip with icon buttons behind the message list during swipe. Deferred — current toast pattern is simpler and sufficient for V1.
- **Swipe-to-switch between global views (chat selector):** Initially implemented, then replaced with tap-only bottom tabs + swipe-right for selection mode. The swipe gesture budget was better spent on selection.
- **Per-row override badges (chat selector):** Desktop has interactive count badges that override individual rows. Not implemented in mobile V1 — the global view toggle is sufficient on smaller screens.
- **Onboarding tooltips:** Planned for the grip icon and swipe gestures. Content and implementation deferred to a follow-up session.

